          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "漂泊者"
          },
          "speakerId": 750088,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_8",
          "text": "（后玄骑使的工作竟如此繁复，得帮秧秧分担一些。）",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "（后玄骑使的工作竟如此繁复，得帮秧秧分担一些。）"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [
            {
              "speaker": "漂泊者_选项",
              "speakers": {
                "zh-Hans": "漂泊者_选项"
              },
              "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_9",
              "text": "秧秧，我能帮上忙吗？",
              "texts": {
                "zh-Hans": "秧秧，我能帮上忙吗？"
              },
              "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
              "jumpToId": null,
              "talkId": 8,
              "talkIndex": 7,
              "optionIndex": 0
            }
          ],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/7/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 8,
          "talkIndex": 7
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_10",
          "text": "漂泊者？不妥……为了保护玄方城，你消耗很大，请好好休养，不然我会担心……",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "漂泊者？不妥……为了保护玄方城，你消耗很大，请好好休养，不然我会担心……"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/8/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 9,
          "talkIndex": 8
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_11",
          "text": "请放心，军策府的工作，我可以自己处理……",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "请放心，军策府的工作，我可以自己处理……"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [
            {
              "speaker": "漂泊者_选项",
              "speakers": {
                "zh-Hans": "漂泊者_选项"
              },
              "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_12",
              "text": "我休养好了，也想为你分担。",
              "texts": {
                "zh-Hans": "我休养好了，也想为你分担。"
              },
              "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
              "jumpToId": null,
              "talkId": 10,
              "talkIndex": 9,
              "optionIndex": 0
            }
          ],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/9/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 10,
          "talkIndex": 9
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "speaker": "漂泊者",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "漂泊者"
          },
          "speakerId": 750088,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_13",
          "text": "秧秧你已经做得很好了，我现在没什么问题，玄方城正值用人之际，让我为你分担一二吧。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧你已经做得很好了，我现在没什么问题，玄方城正值用人之际，让我为你分担一二吧。"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/10/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 11,
          "talkIndex": 10
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_14",
          "text": "好……谢谢，有漂泊者你帮忙，我的确会更安心……有件事或许正适合交给你……",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "好……谢谢，有漂泊者你帮忙，我的确会更安心……有件事或许正适合交给你……"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/11/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 12,
          "talkIndex": 11
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_15",
          "text": "天工部的绘寰匠师上报木禺曾化名\"沈渊\"，潜伏天工部多年。以防他还对其他机傀动过手脚，绘寰严格筛选收容了大批存疑机傀。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "天工部的绘寰匠师上报木禺曾化名\"沈渊\"，潜伏天工部多年。以防他还对其他机傀动过手脚，绘寰严格筛选收容了大批存疑机傀。"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/12/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 13,
          "talkIndex": 12
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_16",
          "text": "但木禺手段隐蔽难以分辨，收容区风险机傀数量庞大……若全部销毁，将直接影响玄方城的战线布局。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "但木禺手段隐蔽难以分辨，收容区风险机傀数量庞大……若全部销毁，将直接影响玄方城的战线布局。"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [
            {
              "speaker": "漂泊者_选项",
              "speakers": {
                "zh-Hans": "漂泊者_选项"
              },
              "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_17",
              "text": "需要精准排查隐患？",
              "texts": {
                "zh-Hans": "需要精准排查隐患？"
              },
              "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
              "jumpToId": null,
              "talkId": 14,
              "talkIndex": 13,
              "optionIndex": 0
            }
          ],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/13/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 14,
          "talkIndex": 13
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "speaker": "秧秧",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "秧秧"
          },
          "speakerId": 108,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_18",
          "text": "正是。若能查明木禺在天工部的行为痕迹，或许能启动二次筛查，减少机傀损耗，漂泊者，这件事可以拜托你吗？",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "正是。若能查明木禺在天工部的行为痕迹，或许能启动二次筛查，减少机傀损耗，漂泊者，这件事可以拜托你吗？"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/14/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
            "flowListName": "剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪",
            "flowId": 5,
            "stateId": 1
          },
          "talkId": 15,
          "talkIndex": 14
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "speaker": "漂泊者",
          "speakers": {
            "zh-Hans": "漂泊者"
          },
          "speakerId": 750088,
          "textKey": "35TUOZUI_3_19",
          "text": "交给我吧，我一定尽力调查。",
          "texts": {
            "zh-Hans": "交给我吧，我一定尽力调查。"
          },
          "textSource": "rebuild_v2_flowstate",
          "options": [],
          "jumpToId": null,
          "playVoice": true,
          "sourcePath": "QuestNodeData:/Data/Condition/AddOptions/0/Option/Type/Flow -> 剧情_3_5_支线_不白之罪_5_1:/2/TalkItems/15/TidTalk",
          "flow": {
